#: CalendarTool.cpp:73
msgid ""
"End date is before start date! Please make sure that end date comes after "
"start date."
msgstr ""
"Enndatum is fröher as dat Startdatum! Dat Enndatum mutt later as dat "
"Startdatum wesen."

#: CalendarTool.cpp:73 CalendarTool.cpp:78
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Fehler"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Calendars should not be longer than 10 years. If you really need such long "
"periods you need to split them up."
msgstr ""
"Kalenners schöölt nich länger as teihn Johren wesen. Wenn so lang Tietrüüm "
"bruukt warrt, mööt se opdeelt warrn."

#: CalendarTool.cpp:83
msgid ""
"Start and end dates are equal! Only one day will be inserted, do you want to "
"continue?"
msgstr ""
"Start- un Enndatum sünd liek! Bloots een Dag warrt inföögt. Wullt Du "
"wiedermaken?"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:83 CalendarTool.cpp:88 CalendarTool.cpp:104
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Wohrschoen"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:88
msgid ""
"Creating a calendar for a longer period than a year can take up a lot of "
"space, do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Dat Opstellen vun en Kalenner de länger as een Johr is, kann veel "
"Spiekerplatz bruken. Wullt Du wiedermaken?"

#: CalendarTool.cpp:104
msgid ""
"The area where the calendar is inserted is NOT empty, are you sure you want "
"to continue, overwriting existing data? If you choose No the area that would "
"be required for the desired calendar will be selected so you can see what "
"data would be overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Dat Rebeet, binnen dat de Kalenner inföögt warrn schall, is NICH leddig. "
"Wullt Du redig wiedermaken un de al vörhannen Daten överschrieven? Wenn Du "
"\"Nee\" anklickst, warrt dat för den Kalenner bruukt Rebeet markeert, so dat "
"Du Di de Daten ankieken kannst, de överschreven wöörn."

